## Safe / Unsafe Quotient Canary
safe_quotients=('flow_class', 'allowed_exit', 'owner_union', 'sheet_pgf_bucket')
unsafe_quotients=('owner_union_size', 'endpoint_ranks', 'branch_hist', 'size', 'mirror_closed')
reading=HYP-3520 already supplies the tail-error guard: safe quotients can emit terminal class; unsafe scalar quotients must hold sidecars.

