## Proof Pull
P1: State a GuardedEmission lemma: a proof token is legal only when the visible quotient is constant over all hidden tails, or a named holdback sidecar is carried.
P2: Apply it to random031: private status may emit through C/F/N/T or I/Q, but full route emission needs R or route reconstruction.
P3: Apply it to HYP-3520/HYP-3522: owner residual (45,173) may emit only after transport word, branch-boundary lift, residual pair, and route R are visible.
P4: Treat raw counts 12/40/79/242/282 as checksums, never as theorem-facing digits before guarded emission.
